# 🛒 Manual Software Testing Portfolio - Automation Exercise

## 📌 Project Overview
This project contains a complete, end-to-end Manual Testing lifecycle (STLC) performed on the [Automation Exercise](https://automationexercise.com/) e-commerce platform.

The goal was to test core functional modules, validate user workflows, design comprehensive Test Cases, identify and log real bugs, maintain a Requirements Traceability Matrix (RTM), and produce a final Test Summary Report.

---

## 🛠️ Testing Deliverables Included
- **Requirements Traceability Matrix (RTM):** Mapping 24 Test Cases to User Stories to ensure 100% Test Coverage.
- **Test Cases:** Detailed test suites covering standard and edge scenarios.
- **Bug Reports:** 7 logged defects mapped with clear Steps to Reproduce, Severity, and Expected vs Actual results.
- **Test Summary Report:** Executive summary analyzing test execution metrics and final Sign-off decision.

---

## 📊 Key Testing Metrics
- **Total Test Cases Executed:** 24
- **Passed:** 17 (70.8%)
- **Failed:** 7 (29.2%)
- **Test Coverage:** 100%
- **Final Sign-off Status:** `NOT READY FOR PRODUCTION` (Pending fix of 7 open Jira bugs)

---

## 📁 Repository Structure
- `01-Requirements-and-RTM/` - RTM document in Excel format.
- `02-Test-Cases/` - Comprehensive Test Cases sheet.
- `03-Bug-Reports/` - Detailed Bug Reports.
- `04-Test-Summary-Report/` - Final STLC Sign-off Report.

